      "notes": "IMPORTANT FACTS YOU SHOULD KNOW\nMelatonin works in harmony with your natural sleep cycle to give you the tranquil rest you deserve, so you can awaken feeling refreshed.* Inspired by the natural rhythm of life, Melatonin is a wonderful supplement for people experiencing occasional sleeplessness, those with jet lag, or those seeking to improve their quality of rest."
